            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "occasionally i use `d%`. since i prefer the behavior of `sf(` (compared to the default `%`), i tried using `sf(` as a motion, but it didn’t work.\n\nbecause `H.has_global_mapping` defaults `mode` to a string, i temporarily commented it out for quick testing.",
