            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`.\n\nThe solution was not as easy as just \"use `{ 'n', 'x', 'o' }` modes instead of a single `'n'`\". Mostly due to Operator-pending mode having to support dot-repeat. After a small refactor of how mappings are created, adding this was pretty straightforward.",
